le=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-1 span-10 colstart-1 colend-11 no-frame-overflow align-top first-child no-parallax type-text id-225  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"  data-yvel=\"1\" ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_225 \" ><h1 class=\"_headline\"><span style=\"font-size: 72px;\">Karolis Kosas is a product designer at OpenAI, previously Stripe.</span></h1></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  row-col-amt-2 no-stickies no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-1\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-1 span-5 colstart-1 colend-6 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-text id-226  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\" style=\"transform:translate3d(0vw, 2.5vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1.1\"  data-offsetx=\"0\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"2.5\" data-offsetymu=vw><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_226 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\">CUJO — Home Internet Security</h1><p class=\"_quote\">CUJO is a home internet security company, providing the power of enterprise security solutions in a simple and elegant device. I helped CUJO shape their brand and user experience.</p><p class=\"_quote\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://karoliskosas.com/cujo-3/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"239\" data-title=\"CUJO\"><span class=\"_link\">See more</span></a></p></div></div><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-1 span-5 colstart-7 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-middle not-first-child no-parallax type-img id-227  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"img\" style=\"transform:translate3d(5vw, 0vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1\"  data-offsetx=\"5\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"0\" data-offsetymu=vw><div  class=\"img image-transparent-bg portrait  \" data-id=99  ><img class=\"lay-gif lazyload \" src=\"data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhFAAUAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAAUABQAAAIRhI+py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7rxUAOw==\" data-src=\"https://karoliskosas.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/cujo.gif\" data-ar=\"1.21625\" alt=\"Karolis Kosas\"  data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"973\" data-id=\"99\" style=\"aspect-ratio:800/973;\"/><div class=\"ph\" style=\"padding-bottom:121.625%;\"></div></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  row-col-amt-2 no-stickies no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-2\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-0 span-5 colstart-0 colend-5 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-img id-228  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"img\" style=\"transform:translate3d(-5vw, 0vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1\"  data-offsetx=\"-5\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"0\" data-offsetymu=vw><div  class=\"img  portrait  \" data-id=385  ><img class=\"lay-image-original lazyload \" src=\"data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhFAAUAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAAUABQAAAIRhI+py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7rxUAOw==\" data-src=\"https://karoliskosas.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/yplan-768x1074.jpg\" data-ar=\"1.3984375\" alt=\"Karolis Kosas\"  data-w=\"768\" data-h=\"1074\" data-id=\"385\" style=\"aspect-ratio:768/1074;\"/><div class=\"ph\" style=\"padding-bottom:139.84375%;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-1 span-5 colstart-6 colend-11 no-frame-overflow align-middle not-first-child no-parallax type-text id-229  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\" style=\"transform:translate3d(0vw, 5vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1.1\"  data-offsetx=\"0\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"5\" data-offsetymu=vw><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_229 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\">Event Discovery Platform YPlan</h1><p class=\"_quote\">As a creative director, I was responsible for bringing YPlan’s mobile experience into the web, optimizing the checkout funnel, and developing UX for new features. YPlan was acquired by the TimeOut group in 2016. </p><p class=\"_quote\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://karoliskosas.com/yplan-2/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"257\" data-title=\"YPlan\"><span class=\"_link\">See more</span></a></p></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  row-col-amt-2 no-stickies no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-3\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-1 span-5 colstart-1 colend-6 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-text id-230  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\" style=\"transform:translate3d(0vw, 5vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1.1\"  data-offsetx=\"0\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"5\" data-offsetymu=vw><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_230 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\">Film Utility App <span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">Cinema Club </span></h1><p class=\"_quote\">Cinema Club is focussed on simplifying the process of finding showtimes and booking tickets in the cinemas across UK and the US. Developed in under a year, Cinema Club was featured on the Apple App Store and Google Play.</p><p class=\"_quote\"><a href=\"https://karoliskosas.com/cinemaclub/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"328\" data-title=\"Cinema Club\"><span class=\"_link\">See more</span></a></p></div></div><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-1 span-5 colstart-7 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-middle not-first-child no-parallax type-img id-231  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"img\" style=\"transform:translate3d(5vw, 0vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1\"  data-offsetx=\"5\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"0\" data-offsetymu=vw><div  class=\"img  portrait  \" data-id=383  ><img class=\"lay-image-original lazyload \" src=\"data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhFAAUAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAAUABQAAAIRhI+py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7rxUAOw==\" data-src=\"https://karoliskosas.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/cinema-club-1-768x901.jpg\" data-ar=\"1.1731770833333\" alt=\"Karolis Kosas\"  data-w=\"768\" data-h=\"901\" data-id=\"383\" style=\"aspect-ratio:768/901;\"/><div class=\"ph\" style=\"padding-bottom:117.31770833333%;\"></div></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  row-col-amt-2 no-stickies no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-4\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-0 span-7 colstart-0 colend-7 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-img id-743  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"img\" style=\"transform:translate3d(-10vw, 0vw, 0);\"   data-offsetx=\"-10\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"0\" data-offsetymu=vw><div  class=\"img image-transparent-bg landscape  \" data-id=381  ><img class=\"lay-image-original lazyload \" src=\"data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhFAAUAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAAUABQAAAIRhI+py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7rxUAOw==\" data-src=\"https://karoliskosas.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/500_Artboard-4-1024x1006-1.png\" data-ar=\"0.982421875\" alt=\"Karolis Kosas\"  data-w=\"1024\" data-h=\"1006\" data-id=\"381\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1024/1006;\"/><div class=\"ph\" style=\"padding-bottom:98.2421875%;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-0 span-4 colstart-7 colend-11 no-frame-overflow align-middle not-first-child no-parallax type-text id-1231  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\" style=\"transform:translate3d(0vw, 5vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1.1\"  data-offsetx=\"0\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"5\" data-offsetymu=vw><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_1231 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">Rapt Studio</span></h1><p class=\"_quote\">Rapt Studio's work blurs the boundaries between space, brand and digital. I helped to define Rapt’s online content strategy and design a website showcasing over 20 years of cutting edge work for Google, IBM Adobe and the likes.</p><p class=\"_quote\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://karoliskosas.com/rapt/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"135\" data-title=\"Rapt Studio\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"color: #b09843;\"><span class=\"_link\">See more</span></span></span></a></p></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  row-col-amt-2 no-stickies no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-5\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-1 span-4 colstart-1 colend-5 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-text id-235  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\" style=\"transform:translate3d(0vw, 5vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1.1\"  data-offsetx=\"0\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"5\" data-offsetymu=vw><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_235 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\">MUBI — Curated Film Network</h1><p class=\"_quote\">With only 30 films available at any one time, MUBI is like Netflix without the bloat. I helped MUBI to build their social network for film lovers, as well as develop their mobile and TV apps.</p><p class=\"_quote\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://karoliskosas.com/mubi-5/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"354\" data-title=\"MUBI\"><span class=\"_link\">See more</span></a></p></div></div><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-1 span-6 colstart-6 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-middle not-first-child no-parallax type-img id-236  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"img\" style=\"transform:translate3d(5vw, 0vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1\"  data-offsetx=\"5\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"0\" data-offsetymu=vw><div  class=\"img  portrait  \" data-id=384  ><img class=\"lay-image-original lazyload \" src=\"data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhFAAUAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAAUABQAAAIRhI+py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7rxUAOw==\" data-src=\"https://karoliskosas.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/mubi-2-768x928.jpg\" data-ar=\"1.2083333333333\" alt=\"Karolis Kosas\"  data-w=\"768\" data-h=\"928\" data-id=\"384\" style=\"aspect-ratio:768/928;\"/><div class=\"ph\" style=\"padding-bottom:120.83333333333%;\"></div></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  row-col-amt-2 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-6\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-0 span-6 colstart-0 colend-6 no-frame-overflow align-bottom first-child no-parallax type-img id-237  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"img\"  data-yvel=\"1\" ><div  class=\"img  portrait  \" data-id=26  ><img class=\"lay-image-original lazyload \" src=\"data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhFAAUAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAAUABQAAAIRhI+py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7rxUAOw==\" data-src=\"https://karoliskosas.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/iPhone-6-Gold.jpg\" data-ar=\"1.1841463414634\" alt=\"Karolis Kosas\"  data-w=\"1640\" data-h=\"1942\" data-id=\"26\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1640/1942;\"/><div class=\"ph\" style=\"padding-bottom:118.41463414634%;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-1 span-4 colstart-7 colend-11 no-frame-overflow align-middle not-first-child no-parallax type-text id-238  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\" style=\"transform:translate3d(0vw, 5vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1.1\"  data-offsetx=\"0\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"5\" data-offsetymu=vw><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_238 \" ><p class=\"_quote\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular; color: #999999;\">Private</span></p><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\">Mobile and TV Experience for <span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">Nowness</span></h1></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  row-col-amt-2 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-7\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-1 span-4 colstart-1 colend-5 no-frame-overflow align-bottom first-child no-parallax type-text id-239  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\" style=\"transform:translate3d(0vw, 5vw, 0);\" data-yvel=\"1.1\"  data-offsetx=\"0\" data-offsetxmu=vw data-offsety=\"5\" data-offsetymu=vw><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_239 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">Anchovy — </span>Gradient Maker</h1><p class=\"_quote\">Anchovy is an extremely simple iPhone app that turns words into color gradient postcards, that can be mailed on demand to any address in the world straight from the app.</p><p><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/app/anchovy/id1062341095?mt=8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"_link\">Get the app</span></a></p></div></div><div class=\"col has-offset place-normal push-1 span-6 colstart-6 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-middle not-first-child no-p