dding-bottom:79.9%;\"></div></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  row-col-amt-2 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-y-offsets no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-12\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-1 span-4 colstart-1 colend-5 no-frame-overflow align-top first-child no-parallax type-text id-250  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_250 \" ><p class=\"_Default\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">Writing —</span><br /><a href=\"https://medium.com/yplan-eng/how-to-give-people-what-they-want-and-not-loose-your-soul-b160712de2e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><br /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@karoliskosas/about-getting-lost-9faec0feb21c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">About getting lost — <span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">2016</span></a></p><p class=\"_Default\"><a href=\"https://medium.com/yplan-eng/how-to-give-people-what-they-want-and-not-loose-your-soul-b160712de2e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to give people what they want and not lose your soul — <span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">2015</span><br /></a><a href=\"http://www.anonymous-press.com/autonomous-systems.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Autonomous systems — 2013</a></p></div></div><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-1 span-5 colstart-6 colend-11 no-frame-overflow align-bottom not-first-child no-parallax type-text id-251  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_251 \" ><p class=\"_Default\"><span style=\"font-family: Ogg-Roman;\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">Talks —</span><br /><br /></span><a href=\