rid.id-2 .absolute-position.push-12{left: calc( 10% + (100% - 20%) / 12 * 12 + 1%);}#custom-phone-grid.id-2 .absolute-position.push-12.place-at-end-of-col{left: calc( 10% + (100% - 20%) / 12 * 13 + 1% - 1%);}</style>\n                        <!-- background color css --><style>#custom-phone-grid.id-2, .cover-region-phone.id-2 .cover-inner{background-color:transparent;}</style>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"row  one-col-row row-col-amt-1 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-y-offsets no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage first-row row-0\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-0 span-12 colstart-0 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-top first-child no-parallax type-text id-225  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_225 \" ><h1 class=\"_headline\"><span style=\"font-size: 64px;\">Karolis Kosas is a <a href=\"https://karoliskosas.com/about/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"100\" data-title=\"About\">product designer</a>.</span></h1></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  one-col-row row-col-amt-1 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-y-offsets no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-1\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-0 span-12 colstart-0 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-text id-226  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_226 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\">CUJO — Home Internet Security</h1><p class=\"_quote\">CUJO is a home internet security company, providing the power of enterprise security solutions in a simple and elegant device. I helped CUJO shape their brand and user experience.</p><p class=\"_quote\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"http://karoliskosas.com/cujo-3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"239\" data-title=\"CUJO\"><span class=\"_link\">See more</span></a></p></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  one-col-row row-col-amt-1 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-y-offsets no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-2\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-0 span-12 colstart-0 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-text id-229  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_229 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\">UK's Largest Event Discovery Platform YPlan</h1><p class=\"_quote\">As a creative director, I was responsible for bringing YPlan’s mobile experience into the web, optimizing the checkout funnel, and developing UX for new features. YPlan was acquired by the TimeOut group in 2016. </p><p class=\"_quote\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"http://karoliskosas.com/yplan-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"257\" data-title=\"YPlan\"><span class=\"_link\">See more</span></a></p></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  one-col-row row-col-amt-1 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-y-offsets no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-3\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-0 span-12 colstart-0 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-text id-230  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_230 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\">Film Utility App Cinema Club </h1><p class=\"_quote\">Cinema Club is focussed on simplifying the process of finding showtimes and booking tickets in the cinemas across UK and the US. Developed in under a year, Cinema Club was featured on the Apple App Store and Google Play.</p><p class=\"_quote\"><a href=\"http://karoliskosas.com/cinemaclub/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"328\" data-title=\"Cinema Club\"><span class=\"_link\">See more</span></a></p></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  one-col-row row-col-amt-1 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-y-offsets no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-4\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-0 span-12 colstart-0 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-text id-1231  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_1231 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">Rapt Studio</span></h1><p class=\"_quote\">Rapt Studio's work blurs the boundaries between space, brand and digital. I helped to define Rapt’s online content strategy and design a website showcasing over 20 years of cutting edge work for Google, IBM Adobe and the likes.</p><p class=\"_quote\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"http://karoliskosas.com/rapt/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"135\" data-title=\"Rapt Studio\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"color: #b09843;\"><span class=\"_link\">See more</span></span></span></a></p></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  one-col-row row-col-amt-1 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-y-offsets no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-5\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-0 span-12 colstart-0 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-text id-235  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_235 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">MUBI — </span>Curated Film Network</h1><p class=\"_quote\">With only 30 films available at any one time, MUBI is like Netflix without the bloat. I helped MUBI to build their social network for film lovers, as well as develop their mobile and TV apps.</p><p class=\"_quote\"><a href=\"http://karoliskosas.com/mubi-5/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"354\" data-title=\"MUBI\"><span class=\"_link\">See more</span></a></p></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  one-col-row row-col-amt-1 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-y-offsets no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-6\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-0 span-12 colstart-0 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-middle first-child no-parallax type-text id-239  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_239 \" ><h1 class=\"_HeadlineProject\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">Anchovy </span>Online to Offline Messenger</h1><p class=\"_quote\">Anchovy is an extremely simple iPhone app that turns words into color gradient postcards, that can be mailed on demand to any address in the world straight from the app.</p><p><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/app/anchovy/id1062341095?mt=8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"_link\">Get the app</span></a></p></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  one-col-row row-col-amt-1 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-y-offsets no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-7\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-0 span-12 colstart-0 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-bottom first-child no-parallax type-text id-250  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_250 \" ><p class=\"_Default\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">Writing</span><br /><a href=\"https://medium.com/yplan-eng/how-to-give-people-what-they-want-and-not-loose-your-soul-b160712de2e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><br /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://medium.com/@karoliskosas/about-getting-lost-9faec0feb21c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">About getting lost — 2016</a></p><p class=\"_Default\"><a href=\"https://medium.com/yplan-eng/how-to-give-people-what-they-want-and-not-loose-your-soul-b160712de2e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to give people what they want and not lose your soul — 2015<br /></a></p><p class=\"_Default\"><a href=\"http://www.anonymous-press.com/autonomous-systems.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Autonomous systems — 2013</a></p></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div><div class=\"row  one-col-row row-col-amt-1 absolute-positioning-vertically-in-apl no-stickies no-y-offsets no-horizontal-grid no-webglslideshow no-row-hoverimage  row-8\"  data-collapsed=\"false\"  >\n            \n            \n            \n                    \n            <div class=\"row-inner \" style=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"column-wrap \" style=\" \"><div class=\"col no-offset place-normal push-0 span-12 colstart-0 colend-12 no-frame-overflow align-bottom first-child no-parallax type-text id-251  no-sticky\"   data-type=\"text\"   ><div class=\"text lay-textformat-parent text_251 \" ><p class=\"_Default\"><span style=\"font-family: Ogg-Roman;\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">Talks</span><br /><br /></span><a href=\"http://2015.jamlondon.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jam — <span style=\"font-family: Ogg-Roman;\"><span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">London 2015</span><br /></span></a><a href=\"http://datamat.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Datamates — <span style=\"font-family: Aeonik-Regular;\">London 2016</span></a></p></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><!-- End CPL Layout --><div id=\"footer-region\"><div id=\"footer\" class=\"footer grid\">\n                        <!-- grid frame css --><style>@media (min-width: 601px){#footer{padding-top:160px;}#footer{padding-bottom:160px;}}</style>\n                        <!-- rows margin bottom css --><style>@media (min-width: 601px){}</style>\n                        <!-- grid css --><style id=\"grid-css\">@media (min-width: 601px){#footer .column-wrap:not(._100vh):not(.rowcustomheight){display:grid;grid-template-columns:0% minmax(0, 1fr) 2% minmax(0, 1fr) 2% minmax(0, 1fr) 2% minmax(0, 1fr) 2% minmax(0, 1fr) 2% minmax(